ind":"update","title":"Demo update!","summary":"After a long time spent working on the demo update, I’ve finally released it. Although I’ve tested it countless times, some stuff may don't work as intended. Please let me know if anything breaks to the point of ruining the experience; I’ll fix things as soon as possible, but not too soon of course. GAMEPLAY CHANGES* New Intro level (Amanda's segment)* Increased Shotgun Firerate* Added Coyote timer* Move speed vastly increased* Added Slide-Kick ability (SHIFT key)* Increased FOV (Field of view)*","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T21:18:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702992","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3860970-1836506165565833","game_id":"steam-3860970","kind":"announcement","title":"Updating VAL'TY demo","summary":"Hello. Thank you so much to everyone who tested the Val'ty demo, added the game to their wishlists, offered suggestions, and reported issues.Don't worry, I won't be taking the demo down; this post is simply to discuss the future.Right now, I'm working on two projects: Val'ty and \"Evangelho da Carne\" (another punk-esoteric horror game in Tamashii/Teocida universe). I appreciate your patience while waiting for updates, considering how long it takes to make one game, imagine doing two at once.Anywa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T15:58:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165565833","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3860970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:47:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:47:19Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"ste